# Tier bench: the fixed-seed Score Chase deal on the desk, the cursor on a column and a card selected, the lamp and motes running.
until 600 Daily Deal
frames 30
click =Modes
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Open Score Chase
until 120 Roll a random seed
frames 10
click Challenge seed
frames 5
type brass-owl-42
frames 5
click =Play seed
until 300 chase-brass-owl-42
frames 120
measure start
key ArrowDown 1
frames 280
key Enter 1
frames 320
measure stop
